· Labeling, such as black box or other warnings or contra indications;
· Post-market surveillance, post-market studies or post-market clinical trials;
· Packaging, storage, distribution, safety surveillance, advertising, promotion, recordkeeping and reporting of safety and other post-market
information;
· Monitoring and reporting adverse events and instances of the failure of a product to meet the specifications in the NDA;
· Compliance with cGMPs;
· Changes to the approved product, product labeling or manufacturing process;
· Advertising and other promotional material; and
· Disclosure of clinical trial results on publicly available databases.
In addition, the distribution, sale and marketing of our products are subject to a number of additional requirements, including:
· State wholesale drug distribution laws and the distribution of our product samples to physicians must comply with the requirements of the
